// Third pass on the field guide (checked 2026-11-18):
//  1. DEPTH brings every guide up to the same standard: a real quick check, five-plus steps where the
//     job allows, best practices and at least three trade tricks.
//  2. EXTRA_GUIDES adds the small jobs that come up most: drywall holes, pictures and shelves, shower
//     heads, aerators, clogs, window and trim caulk, sticky windows, door slabs, fan wobble, garage
//     door basics and spring start-up.
// Same rules as the rest of the guide: the product's own instructions win, nothing here expands
// YNSG's approved services, and every guide says when to stop and refer.

